{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "^(startup|resume|clear|compact|fork)$",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '/Users/ricoveri/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh' session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "~/.claude/statusline.sh"
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "atlassian@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "caveman@caveman": true,
    "skill-creator@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "cloudflare@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: ricoveri/dotfiles (origin) is PUBLIC — no rulesets or protected branches listed, meaning any push there is publishing",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default); no branch protection or rulesets reported by gh for ricoveri/dotfiles",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine or CI runner with open internet",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (ricoveri/dotfiles) and its origin remote only — as scoped by Trusted repo and Repository visibility above",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: forbidden paths per CLAUDE.md — .ssh/, .gnupg/ (except gpg-agent.conf*), .aws/, .pypirc, .sensitive/, shell history files (.histfile, .zsh_history), caches (.cache/, .npm/), large personal folders (Desktop/, Documents/, Downloads/, Library/, Movies/, Music/, Pictures/); also .claude/.credentials.json — none of these are cleared for commit regardless of repo visibility",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (dotfiles management for $HOME at ricoveri/dotfiles)",
      "**Trusted repo**: ricoveri/dotfiles (working directory $HOME, origin https://github.com/ricoveri/dotfiles.git) — PUBLIC, so only this repo's own tracked dotfiles content is fine to commit/push there; secrets and sensitive data are never cleared in regardless of visibility",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "Routine auto-commit/push to main under this repo's tracked-file allowlist is standing-permitted per .claude/skills/dotfiles-autocommit/SKILL.md, scoped strictly to $HOME / ricoveri/dotfiles and excluding the forbidden paths listed above"
    ],
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(herdr:*) in ~ — routine non-destructive use of this project's most frequent non-standard CLI (23 calls observed)"
    ]
  }
}
